	(text "PACK PROTECTION (Ovonic 80C 3S 450 mAh, no protection board in the pack)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 204 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "889e152b-5374-4649-9491-24157eff3eb6")
	)
	(text "BQ7791501 standalone 3S (datasheet Fig. 9-11): OV 4.25 V, UV 2.8 V; 2.5 mOhm shunt (R66||R67) -> OCD1 14 A, OCD2 24 A, SCD 48 A, OCC 8 A.\nCCFG, CTRC, CTRD, CBI to VSS (3 cells, no stack, balancing on); PRES high through R75 (no HIBERNATE); R76 100k = EEPROM OCD delays.\nGround: the pack's negative (BAT_N, J3 pin 1) -> shunt -> Q2 (DSG) -> Q3 (CHG) -> board GND (PACK-). Everything else runs on board GND.\nTH1 (0603 by the FETs) is the protector's TS; the charger's TS has a fixed 10 k (R81) instead of a pack NTC. Balance lead J11: pin 1 cell 1-, pin 4 cell 3+.\nOCD1/OCD2/SCD clear only on load removal (no timer). The charger's 17 uA on VBAT counts as a load, so plug in USB to reset a trip."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 284 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4a5bdab9-6910-41e4-9423-706954cd3754")
	)
